            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.6.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ubuso 6:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Pantu ifi efyasosa Imfumu Yawe ati, ine nkaletela Yerusalemu ifinkunka fine ifyabipisha, ni nkondo, ne cipowe, ne fiswango, ne cikuko, efikesa ipaulula abantu kumo kwine ne fitekwa fyabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo kukaba bamo abakapusukako, abana abaume na bana banakashi abakafumishiwamo mu musumba. Aba bakesa uko muli, elyo ilyo mukamona imibeele yabo ne micitile yabo, lyena mukashininkisha ukuti ifinkunka fyonse ifyo ndetele Yerusalemu, kanshi nafilolamo. ",
